From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:30:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] feat: let customers apply a discount code at checkout

POST /checkout takes an optional discount_code. An unknown or expired code
is a 422 and nothing is charged. The Customers table in docs/api.md is
realigned because the checkout row got wider; only that row's text changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
